<ul class="hub-grid"><li><a class="hub-card" href="/profiles"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/hagia-sophia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">394 profiles</span><span class="hub-card-t">Profiles</span><span class="hub-card-d">In-depth histories of states and empires: how each rose, lived, fought, governed and fell, with key facts and timelines.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/encyclopedia/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/library-of-alexandria.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">31,955 entries</span><span class="hub-card-t">Encyclopedia</span><span class="hub-card-d">People, places, events, institutions and ideas, with 21,801 historical pictures.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/state/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/peace-of-westphalia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">5,463 states</span><span class="hub-card-t">States</span><span class="hub-card-d">Every kingdom, principality, republic and chiefdom of the register, with its lineage and connections.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/atlas"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/catalan-atlas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">From 3500 BCE to today</span><span class="hub-card-t">Atlas</span><span class="hub-card-d">The world in any year: slide through five thousand years and watch states appear and vanish.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/countries/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/great-wall-of-china.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">190 countries</span><span class="hub-card-t">Country Histories</span><span class="hub-card-d">The history of each present-day country, told through the states that lay on its soil.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/centuries/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/bayeux-tapestry.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">51 centuries</span><span class="hub-card-t">Centuries</span><span class="hub-card-d">World history one century at a time: the great powers, key events, people and a map.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/explorer"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/trajans-column.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Power curves</span><span class="hub-card-t">Empire Explorer</span><span class="hub-card-d">Compare the rise and fall of nearly four hundred states and empires on one timeline.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/connections"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/congress-of-berlin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">11,291 links</span><span class="hub-card-t">Connections</span><span class="hub-card-d">Who succeeded, conquered, ruled or merged with whom: the states as one network.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/paths/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/marco-polo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">8 paths</span><span class="hub-card-t">Reading Paths</span><span class="hub-card-d">Themed routes across profiles and entries, from the Silk Road to the steppe empires.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/today-in-history/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/mesoamerican-long-count-calendar.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">2,202 events</span><span class="hub-card-t">Today in History</span><span class="hub-card-d">What happened on each day of the year, across five thousand years.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/encyclopedia/glossary"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/code-of-hammurabi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">721 terms</span><span class="hub-card-t">Glossary</span><span class="hub-card-d">Offices, institutions, laws and ideas of the past, each explained in a sentence.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/quiz"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rosetta-stone.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">New every day</span><span class="hub-card-t">History Quiz</span><span class="hub-card-d">Guess the empire, person, event or place from four clues, or practise as long as you like.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/research-series"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thucydides.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Essays</span><span class="hub-card-t">Research Series</span><span class="hub-card-d">Thematic essays on the forces behind the rise and collapse of civilisations.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/dataset"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rhind-mathematical-papyrus.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">CC BY 4.0</span><span class="hub-card-t">Open Data</span><span class="hub-card-d">The states register (5,463 states, 11,291 relations) and the power curves, free to reuse.</span></span></a></li></ul>
